#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.glade:513
msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "Zaženi skeniranje obraza"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Optično preberi model obraza"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Modela obraza ni mogoče shraniti"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Optično preberi drugi model"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Drugega modela ni bilo mogoče posneti"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Vaš prvi model je shranjen, zato prijava z obrazom že deluje. Poskrbit"
"e, da je vaš obraz dobro osvetljen in na sredini, nato poskusite znova"
" — ali preskočite in model dodajte pozneje v Nastavitvah."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Dodaj model obraza (obvezno)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Prijava z obrazom potrebuje vsaj en model obraza, zato tega branja ni "
"mogoče preskočiti. Posnemite ga pri svetlobi, v kateri običajno sedite"
". Osvetlitev spremeni, kako kamera vidi vaš obraz, zato razmislite, da"
" pozneje v Nastavitvah dodate drugi model, posnet pri drugačni svetlob"
"i (na primer zvečer pri svetilkah namesto pri dnevni svetlobi)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Dodaj drugi model obraza (priporočeno)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Vaš prvi model je shranjen. Osvetlitev spremeni, kako kamera vidi vaš "
"obraz: model, posnet pri dnevni svetlobi, lahko zvečer pri svetilkah o"
"dpove (ali obratno) in Ubuntu Hello takrat poteče, namesto da bi odkle"
"nil. Drugi model, posnet pri drugačni svetlobi, ohranja prepoznavanje "
"zanesljivo ob kateri koli uri dneva."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Najprej spremenite osvetlitev: prižgite ali ugasnite luč v sobi ali na"
"mizno svetilko, obrnite se stran od okna ali si nadenite očala, ki jih"
" včasih nosite. Nato poglejte naravnost v kamero in pritisnite Preberi"
"."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Nastavitev Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello lahko samodejno odklene vaš {} z uporabo preverjanja pris"
"tnosti obraza (zaznana denarnica: {}).\n\n<b>Stanje TPM:</b> Preverjan"
"je strojne opreme in orodij TPM ..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello lahko samodejno odklene vaš {} z uporabo preverjanja pris"
"tnosti obraza (zaznana denarnica: {}).\n\n<b>Stanje TPM:</b> zaznana s"
"trojna oprema TPM. Samodejna namestitev <i>tpm2-tools</i> ..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello lahko samodejno odklene vaš {} z uporabo preverjanja pris"
"tnosti obraza (zaznana denarnica: {}).\n\n<b>Stanje TPM:</b> Strojna o"
"prema TPM 2.0 je aktivna. Vaše geslo bo varno zapečateno znotraj TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello lahko samodejno odklene vaš {} z uporabo preverjanja pris"
"tnosti obraza (zaznana denarnica: {}).\n\n<b>Stanje TPM:</b> zaznana s"
"trojna oprema TPM, vendar samodejna namestitev <i>tpm2-tools</i> ni us"
"pela. Zaženite <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Vrnitev na pr"
"ogramsko predpomnjenje poverilnic."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello lahko samodejno odklene vaš {} z uporabo preverjanja pris"
"tnosti obraza (zaznana denarnica: {}).\n\n<b>Stanje TPM:</b> Ni zaznan"
"e strojne opreme TPM. Uporaba programskega predpomnjenja poverilnic (A"
"ES-256-GCM)."

