msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Obesek za ključe / KWallet Samodejno odklepanje"

#: src/main.glade:471
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Omogočite preverjanje pristnosti z obrazom, da samodejno odklenete obe"
"sek ključev za prijavo ali KWallet ob prijavi. To varno shrani vaše ge"
"slo, zapečateno v TPM, ko je na voljo, ali šifrirano z AES-256-GCM z g"
"lavnim ključem samo za root. Preverjanje obraza nastavi PAM_AUTHTOK za"
" pam_gnome_keyring ali pam_kwallet5, odvisno od vašega namizja."

#: src/main.glade:502
